 &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n                        </td>\r\n                    </tr>\r\n                </tbody>\r\n            </table>\r\n            </p>\r\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"margin-top: 8.5pt; line-height: 180%\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 180%; font-family: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; letter-spacing: -1.1pt\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 180%; font-family: &quot;HY헤드라인M&quot;; letter-spacing: -1.1pt\">2. 투표시간</span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 180%; font-family: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; letter-spacing: -1.1pt\"> : 운영기간 중 매일 </span><span style=\"font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt; color: #ff0000; line-height: 180%; font-family: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; letter-spacing: -1.1pt; text-decoration: underline\">오전 6시부터 오후 4시까지</span></p>\r\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"margin-top: 8.5pt; line-height: 180%\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 180%; font-family: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; letter-spacing: -1.1pt\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 180%; font-family: &quot;HY헤드라인M&quot;; letter-spacing: -1.1pt\">3. 투표대상</span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 180%; font-family: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; letter-spacing: -1.1pt\"> : 부재자신고인</span></p>\r\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"margin-top: 8.5pt; line-height: 180%\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 180%; font-family: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; letter-spacing: -1.1pt\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 180%; font-family: &quot;HY헤드라인M&quot;; letter-spacing: -1.1pt\">4. 부재자신고인에 대한 안내 사항</span></p>\r\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"margin-top: 4pt; margin-left: 45.8pt; text-indent: -45.8pt; line-height: 180%\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 180%; font-family: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; letter-spacing: -1.1pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"font-weight: bold; font-size: 13pt; line-height: 180%; font-family: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">가. 부재자 투표 시 반드시 가지고 가야 하는 것</span></p>\r\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"margin-top: 4pt; line-height: 180%\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.4pt; line-height: 180%; font-family: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.4pt; line-height: 180%; font-family: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">❍ </span><span style=\"font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.4pt; line-height: 180%; font-family: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">부재자투표용지</span></p>\r\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"margin-top: 4pt; margin-left: 61.8pt; text-indent: -61.8pt; line-height: 180%\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.4pt; line-height: 180%; font-family: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;❍ </span><span style=\"font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.4pt; line-height: 180%; font-family: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">회송용(작은) 봉투</span></p>\r\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"margin-top: 4pt; margin-left: 56.3pt; text-indent: -56.3pt; line-height: 180%\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.4pt; line-height: 180%; font-family: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;❍ </span><span style=\"font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.4pt; line-height: 180%; font-family: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">신분증명서</span><span style=\"font-size: 12.4pt; line-height: 180%; font-family: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">(주민등록증, 여권, 운전면허증 및 공무원증 외에 관공서 또는</span><span style=\"font-size: 12.4pt; line-height: 180%; font-family: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"> </span><span style=\"font-size: 12.4pt; line-height: 180%; font-family: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">공공기관이 발행하거나 기록․관리하는 사진이 첩부된 자격증 기타 신분을</span><span style=\"font-size: 12.4pt; line-height: 180%; font-family: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"> 확인할 수 있는 서류)</span></p>\r\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"margin-top: 4pt; line-height: 180%\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 180%; font-family: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; letter-spacing: -1.1pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"font-weight: bold; font-size: 13pt; line-height: 180%; font-family: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; letter-spacing: -1pt\">나. 부재자투표 시 유의사항</span><span style=\"font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 180%; font-family: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; letter-spacing: -1.1pt\"> </span></p>\r\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"margin-top: 4pt; margin-left: 54.6pt; text-indent: -54.6pt; line-height: 180%\"><span style=\"font-size: 13pt; line-height: 180%; font-family: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; letter-spacing: -1pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;❍ </span><span style=\"font-weight: bold; font-size: 13pt; line-height: 180%; font-family: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; letter-spacing: -1pt\">후보자 선거공보는 가지고 올 필요 없음.</span></p>\r\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"margin-top: 4pt; margin-left: 54.6pt; text-indent: -54.6pt; line-height: 180%\"><span style=\"font-size: 13pt; line-height: 180%; font-family: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; letter-spacing: -1pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;❍ 부재자투표소에서 투표할 것으로 신고한 부재자신고인이 거소에서 투표한 경우에는 무효 처리</span></p>\r\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"margin-top: 4pt; margin-left: 56.1pt; text-indent: -56.1pt; line-height: 180%\"><span style=\"font-size: 13pt; line-height: 180%; font-family: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; letter-spacing: -1pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;❍ </span><span style=\"font-size: 13pt; line-height: 180%; font-family: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; letter-spacing: -1pt\">부재자투표소에 방문 전 투표용지에 기표한 투표용지는 무효 처리</span></p>\r\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"margin-top: 4pt; margin-left: 65.3pt; text-indent: -65.3pt; line-height: 180%\"><span style=\"font-size: 13pt; line-height: 180%; font-family: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; letter-spacing: -1pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"font-size: 13pt; line-height: 180%; font-family: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; letter-spacing: -1pt\">❍ </span><span style=\"font-weight: bold; font-size: 13pt; line-height: 180%; font-family: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; letter-spacing: -1pt; text-decoration: underline\">신분증명서를 지참하지 아니한 경우 투표 불가</span></p>\r\n            </td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td valign=\"middle\" width=\"182\" height=\"56\" style=\"border-right: medium none; padding-right: 1.4pt; border-top: medium none; padding-left: 1.4pt; padding-bottom: 1.4pt; border-left: #000000 0.4pt solid; padding-top: 1.4pt; border-bottom: #000000 0.4pt solid\">\r\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"line-height: 200%\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 200%; font-family: 한양신명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n            </td>\r\n            <td valign=\"middle\" width=\"68\" height=\"56\" style=\"border-right: medium none; padding-right: 1.4pt; border-top: medium none; padding-left: 1.4pt; padding-bottom: 1.4pt; border-left: medium none; padding-top: 1.4pt; border-bottom: #000000 0.4pt solid\">\r\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"line-height: 200%; text-align: center\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 200%; font-family: 한양신명조,한컴돋움\"><img height=\"35\" src=\"file:///C:/DOCUME~1/user/LOCALS~1/Temp/Hnc/BinData/EMB00000cdc2744.jpg\" width=\"43\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></span></p>\r\n            </td>\r\n            <td valign=\"middle\" width=\"224\" height=\"56\" style=\"border-right: medium none; padding-right: 1.4pt; border-top: medium none; padding-left: 1.4pt; padding-bottom: 1.4pt; border-left: medium none; padding-top: 1.4pt; border-bottom: #000000 0.4pt solid\">\r\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"line-height: 200%\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold; font-size: 16pt; line-height: 200%; font-family: &quot;HY헤드라인M&quot;\">강동구선거관리위원회</span></p>\r\n            </td>\r\n            <td valign=\"middle\" width=\"200\" height=\"56\" style=\"border-right: #000000 0.4pt solid; padding-right: 1.4pt; border-top: medium none; padding-left: 1.4pt; padding-bottom: 1.4pt; border-left: medium none; padding-top: 1.4pt; border-bottom: #000000 0.4pt solid\">\r\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"line-height: 200%\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 200%; font-family: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n            </td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n    </tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</p>": 1,
    "<p>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size: 15px\"> 2012. 12. 19(수) 실시하는 제18대 대통령선거 및 서울특별시교육감재선거에 따른 </span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 15px\">&nbsp;우리구 투표구 및 투표소를 아래와 같이&nbsp;안내하오니 참고하시기 바랍니다.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 15px\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - 선 거 일 : &nbsp;2012. 12. 19(수)&nbsp; 06:00 ~ 18:00</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 15px\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;- 투표장소 :&nbsp; 관내 96개소(별첨 참조)</span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; * <span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 200%; font-family: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">동별&middot;투표구별 상세지도 및 아파트&middot;다세대주택 현황은 강동구선거관리위원회 홈페이지(http://su.election.go.kr/gd)에 게시</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 15px\">첨부 :&nbsp; 투표소 현황 1부.</span></p>": 1
